date-released: "2026-11-13"
url: "https://github.com/edwardaud/QuaST"
repository-code: "https://github.com/edwardaud/QuaST"
license: MIT
# DOI placeholder: it stays commented out because a YAML comment is not metadata.
# When the v0.1.0 tag is published as a GitHub release and Zenodo mints the DOI,
# uncomment this block and put the version DOI in value (docs/paper/availability.md
# carries the same placeholder and the steps that mint it).
# identifiers:
